{
  "title": "直播水族箱 設定教學",
  "subtitle": "約 1 分鐘：從設定頁到 OBS，觀眾就能變成魚",
  "baseUrl": "https://yy2401.github.io/fish-tank/",
  "viewport": [
    1280,
    760
  ],
  "defaultDuration": 4.5,
  "steps": [
    {
      "goto": "index.html",
      "caption": "用 Chrome 打開 yy2401.github.io/fish-tank，這是設定頁",
      "duration": 4
    },
    {
      "caption": "照最上面的三步驟做：先在「Twitch 頻道名稱」填你的頻道名稱，不用登入",
      "highlight": "#channel",
      "before": [
        {
          "fill": [
            "#channel",
            "yy2401"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "caption": "想放在畫面角落：「水族箱範圍」按「右下角」，其他地方會變透明",
      "highlight": ".presets",
      "before": [
        {
          "click": "[data-area=\"0.55,0.03,0.6,0.02\"]"
        },
        {
          "wait": 1500
        }
      ],
      "duration": 5.5
    },
    {
      "caption": "按三步驟的第 2 步，打開「外觀與配色」，點一個配色就換背景",
      "highlight": "#themes",
      "duration": 5.5,
      "before": [
        {
          "click": "[data-go=\"themes\"]"
        },
        {
          "wait": 800
        },
        {
          "click": "[data-theme=\"tropical\"]"
        },
        {
          "wait": 800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "caption": "預覽下面的「魚缸物件」點一個就加進魚缸，在預覽上按住物件拖曳位置、滾輪調大小",
      "highlight": "#preview",
      "before": [
        {
          "click": "#objPalette [data-obj=\"ship\"]"
        },
        {
          "wait": 1800
        },
        {
          "scroll": "#objPalette"
        }
      ],
      "duration": 6
    },
    {
      "caption": "想要本頻道限定魚種：取個名字、按「上傳」選一張圖，觀眾打 !名字 就能變身",
      "highlight": ".skin-add",
      "duration": 5.5,
      "before": [
        {
          "click": "#secSkins summary"
        },
        {
          "wait": 500
        },
        {
          "scroll": "#avatarLbl"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "caption": "稀有魚種：訂閱、贊助小奇點、兌換忠誠點、搶寶箱都能解鎖",
      "highlight": "#bits",
      "duration": 5,
      "before": [
        {
          "click": "#secRare summary"
        },
        {
          "wait": 500
        },
        {
          "scroll": "#listenText"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "caption": "文字、顏色、指令名稱、鯊魚的樣子…都收在 5～7 區，點標題打開，每區都能一鍵還原預設",
      "highlight": "#secText",
      "duration": 5.5,
      "before": [
        {
          "click": "#secText summary"
        },
        {
          "wait": 500
        },
        {
          "scroll": "#secText"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "caption": "設定好了，到右上「複製到 OBS」按「複製」",
      "highlight": "#copy"
    },
    {
      "caption": "下面這個打勾的話，之後開著設定頁改什麼，直播畫面都會自動跟著變，不用再複製",
      "highlight": "label.live",
      "duration": 5.5
    },
    {
      "goto": "docs/video/slide.html?img=1-sources.jpg&box=212,900,26,22",
      "caption": "打開 OBS，在下方「來源」區塊按加號按鈕",
      "highlight": "#hl"
    },
    {
      "goto": "docs/video/slide.html?img=2-add.jpg&box=17,607,283,43",
      "caption": "左邊選「瀏覽器」",
      "highlight": "#hl"
    },
    {
      "goto": "docs/video/slide.html?img=3-new.jpg&box=345,115,1011,76",
      "caption": "按「建立新來源」（舊版 OBS 會先問名稱：填「水族箱」，按確定）",
      "highlight": "#hl",
      "duration": 5.5
    },
    {
      "goto": "docs/video/slide.html?text=網址=按 Ctrl%2BV 貼上剛剛複製的網址|寬度=1920|高度=1080|最後=按「確定」",
      "caption": "在屬性視窗填這三格，按「確定」",
      "highlight": "#card",
      "duration": 6
    },
    {
      "goto": "tank.html?demo=1&event=0",
      "caption": "完成！先用右下角的「測試聊天室」自己試玩：點指令，或按最下面的「加 8 隻測試魚」",
      "highlight": "#demo .chips",
      "after": [
        {
          "click": "[data-act=bots]"
        },
        {
          "wait": 6000
        }
      ],
      "duration": 6
    },
    {
      "caption": "觀眾在聊天室講話或打 !魚，就會變成一隻魚游進你的直播畫面",
      "duration": 5,
      "before": [
        {
          "click": "[data-act=bots]"
        },
        {
          "wait": 5000
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "outro": "完整說明請看《直播水族箱 使用說明書》"
}